WEBVTT

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:50.480
TO THE FINAL BATTLEGROUND

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:09.790
It's time to go.

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:16.920
Tomorrow, warriors from around the world
will gather in Carl Kingdom.

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:19.680
The time to begin
our counterattack has come!

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:21.300
Yes!

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:25.520
But where is everybody?

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:28.690
Did their training not work out?

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.940
Ah! There they are!

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:37.570
Ow, ow, ow!

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.320
Crocodine!

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:43.490
How did your training go?

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.370
Well...

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.620
we'll just have to see in battle.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.040
Oh! There's Popp, too!

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:58.050
Huh? Aw, I thought I'd be the first back.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.720
You thought wrong!

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:06.060
Looks like you learned
a pretty intense spell there, Popp.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:07.810
I guess so.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.730
Isn't Sir Matoriv with you?

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.480
Right. About Mentor...

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:15.400
He said, "I'm tired,
so I'm going to sleep."

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:18.400
Also, "I leave the rest to all of you."

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:24.570
Okay, that leaves three people.
Dai, Hyunckel, and Maam.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.330
You mean two people!

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:33.000
Nice!

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:46.890
That leaves Dai and Hyunckel.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:50.890
Yeah, those two will probably
take the longest.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.400
Since they need
their weapons restored, too.

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.900
Maybe not.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.240
Dai!

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:07.990
Sorry to keep you all waiting!

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:17.210
So, did you master the ways
of the strongest sword?!

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:19.380
Hmm. I'm not sure.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:22.920
Huh? That doesn't sound reassuring.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:27.180
Well, I did what I could
in the time we had.

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:28.640
Okay then!

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:33.480
Well, I'm off.

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.270
Answer me this before you go.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.770
You're a novice with the spear.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:42.190
With a sword, you could have matched me.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.400
So why?

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.320
Because...

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:50.450
this spear was a parting gift
from a dying friend.

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:53.500
A good answer.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:59.800
I've never met anyone able to entrust
their life to their weapon like you.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:03.170
Try to teach that spirit to Dai.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:07.840
Okay, that's everyone.

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.140
Yeah, that's everyone...

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:11.390
Oh!

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:14.560
Hold on a minute!

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:16.810
That's right!

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:18.860
There's one more!

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:21.440
What? What's with those two?

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:23.860
Who else is there?

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.460
The Book of Avan!

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:40.000
This is Master Avan's book?
I've never seen it before.

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.960
I see... They're right.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:45.670
We're going to Master Avan's homeland.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.010
We have to bring this.

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.930
<i>That's right. Our master.</i>

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.770
<i>The one who started all of this.</i>

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:59.520
<i>Without Master Avan,
me, Popp, and Maam...</i>

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:05.110
<i>and even Hyunckel and Crocodine
wouldn't be here like this today!</i>

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:08.530
Master! Let's go together!

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:12.240
This battle will be fought by all of us!

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:46.740
The Reaper.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:48.400
Wow!

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.070
How scary.

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:56.080
I hid my presence and you still sensed me.

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:59.540
No wonder King Vearn
regards you with caution.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:02.500
Finding you was quite a hassle.

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:08.720
I didn't think the legendary Dragon Knight
would be hiding in this remote cave.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.510
What do you want?

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:14.300
You couldn't possibly
be looking to take my life.

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:18.270
What else would an assassin do?

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:22.480
Is that Dark King Vearn's will?

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.740
He made a promise to me.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:32.530
Humans are filth
that pollute the Surface World.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:38.950
He promised to wipe out the humans
and to create a paradise.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:45.040
He asked that I cooperate
and not oppose him until then.

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:52.380
That's why I served under Hadlar
and fought on the front lines.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:57.010
Was that promise a lie?

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:03.480
Of course not.
Everything King Vearn said was true.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:06.440
Indeed the humans will be wiped out.

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:10.400
But it won't be just the humans.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:13.410
The monsters and Dragons and Darklings...

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:18.080
Every creature that lives
on the Surface World will be exterminated.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:23.080
After all, to erase
the Surface World itself...

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:27.540
is King Vearn's true objective.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:28.960
What?

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:34.760
You fought Abyss Dragon King Velzar,
so you should know.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:40.520
Deep below the ground
where we stand right now

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:42.390
lies another world.

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:44.480
The Underworld?!

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:49.940
<i>Correct. The land of darkness
that the gods gave to the Darklings.</i>

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:53.950
<i>A world of chaos where
strength is the only rule.</i>

00:08:54.110 --> 00:09:00.080
<i>King Vearn's true wish is to raise
the Underworld to the Surface World.</i>

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:06.330
This is a secret that not even Hadlar,
his most powerful servant, knows.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.170
Doesn't it sound wonderful?

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:14.970
The Surface World erased,

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:20.050
and humans and monsters and Dragons
all fall to the Underworld.

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:22.430
And only the powerful

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:27.600
and those who enjoy destruction and
slaughter can survive in this new world.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:31.230
This is King Vearn's paradise.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:37.320
And I am to eliminate
any potential threat to that cause!

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:38.820
You fool!

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:48.120
What you described...

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.790
is what people call Hell!

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.260
I-It's been fully restored?

00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:00.350
The Demon Dragon Blade.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:07.230
My Reaper Flute neutralizes the senses.
Yet it didn't work.

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:13.570
This man is more than a simple beast...

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.280
Dark King Vearn.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:23.280
If that's your intent,
then I have ideas of my own.

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:33.750
Oh no! This is terrible!

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:02.160
Take care, Princess!

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:06.080
May the great gods of Papnica bless you!

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:12.920
Wow, look at how small Papnica is!

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:16.420
"Off to the field of battle!
Farewell dear homeland!"

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.300
or something like that, Princess?

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:20.680
You're quite the poet, Popp.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:25.260
It'll be pathetic if you run away
after saying that.

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:31.350
Oh come on. Do you still think of me
as the cowardly chicken?

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:36.270
It was only way back in the beginning
that I acted like that.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.820
For quite a while back in the beginning!

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:39.610
What?!

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:40.530
That's right.

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:41.450
Huh?!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.280
Anyways!

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:50.460
I'm glad Merle came
since she can sense enemies...

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:53.580
but why is Miss Amy here?

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:57.960
You always stay back to protect Papnica.

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:01.670
I-I'm here as Her Majesty's bodyguard.

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:05.430
We don't know
what dangers may threaten her.

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:11.600
Besides, I can lend
a bit of a hand in a fight...

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:17.190
If that's all you can do, then you won't
survive the forces of the Field of Death.

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:20.360
Stick to guarding the Princess.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:27.120
Miss Amy's acting kind of suspicious.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:28.120
How so?

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:31.580
How so? What do you think?

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:35.380
The whole "for the man I love" thing.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:40.590
<i>How can Popp be so perceptive
when it comes to other people?</i>

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:43.260
Don't worry, Hyunckel.

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:48.550
The leaders of the world have gathered
powerful warriors there.

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:53.850
It's worth having Amy there
even to just help and heal them.

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.100
<i>Princess...</i>

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:59.440
Wow. Powerful warriors from all over!

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.320
I wonder what they're like!

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:06.950
Let's hope they're even
half as good as I am.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.620
Powerful warriors...

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:16.250
What's wrong, Hyunckel?
Something worrying you?

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.420
Well...

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:21.050
I understand what the Princess is saying.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:26.220
It's important that
the people of the world stand together.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:27.550
But...

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:34.180
I don't want to drag too many innocents
into this fight with us.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:37.100
I've never actually seen his face,

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:41.320
but I've felt the Dark King's
immense presence.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:46.030
He's not someone
any normal being can stand up to.

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:51.120
True. I know how you feel...

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:49.470
GIGABREAK

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:54.470
REAPER FLUTE

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:07.070
Is this really the place, Leona?

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:11.280
Yes. This is where Carl Castle used to be.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:15.790
The Dark Army demolished it,
leaving nothing behind.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.830
Our base should be near here.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.580
So this is...

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.500
Master Avan's homeland.

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:27.800
Yes. But this isn't the time
to get sentimental.

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.220
That thing's incredible!

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:31.430
It reaches to the top of the clouds!

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:35.970
If that's their stronghold,
it's unbelievably huge!

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:42.230
It looks like the Dark Army is saying,
"We know you're here. Come and get us."

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:50.440
Let's prepare!
We don't know what'll happen!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:03.540
Who's there?!

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:07.340
Whoa! Wait a minute! It's me!

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:12.800
The Bengarna Kingdom
Tank Unit commander, Akhim!

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:17.010
I saw your balloon and came to greet you!

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:21.600
You? We thought you might be an enemy.

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:27.400
What's up? Did you have to shave your head
because you lost the tank unit?

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:31.280
I've always been bald, sir!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:32.950
I see...

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:38.410
More importantly, have you all seen
what happened to the Field of Death?

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:40.540
Yeah. We saw from above.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.370
Then that will save us time.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:45.880
General Bowson awaits you
at the base of operations.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:49.250
I'll show you the way. Please follow me.

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:52.380
Thank you.
Are all the warriors there, too?

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:56.340
No. The warriors aren't
at the base of operations.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:17:00.140
Most of them went
to the shipbuilding base in Zababa.

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:03.980
Hey, what's Zababa?

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:09.570
A small fishing port north of Carl.

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:16.780
We're secretly building a large ship
to take us to the Field of Death.

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:21.200
There'll be almost thirty of us
all together.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.250
We'll need a large ship.

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:27.750
Come to think of it, where did Chiu go?

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:44.020
Y-You! Where did you come from?!

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:49.110
Hmph! So what?!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.900
I'm going to infiltrate
the Field of Death,

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:57.030
and gather information
on the Dark Army for everybody!

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:01.370
How am I going to cross the sea?

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:05.290
Don't underestimate me, my friend!

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:09.380
I'm currently worthy
of the title of Beast King!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:11.630
Ta-da!

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.840
This is the Beast King Flute!

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:18.970
Mr. Crocodine gave it to me
as thanks for helping him train!

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:22.140
It's a wonderful item that lures monsters.

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:27.520
If I can beat them,
they become my followers!

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:34.360
With this, I'll eventually form
a mighty legion of good monsters!

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:40.990
Now then, let's blow this at the sky
and get a flying follower.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:56.590
I-I guess they sometimes come in groups.

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.840
<i>Can I beat them?</i>

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:07.310
Wow! It's almost complete!

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:10.850
We'll ride to the Field of Death in this.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:12.020
Hm?!

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:18.780
What the hell is that?!

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.660
The Dark Army?!

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:35.340
You peons are annoying us
from the opposite shore.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.750
Get real!

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:40.470
You've got a lot of nerve
coming here alone!

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:44.100
I would have preferred to come alone.

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:27.350
You'll be fighting all five
of the Hadlar Royal Guard.

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.820
We've been waiting for you!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.440
And now all the world's warriors
have gathered.

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:44.160
All that's left is to wait for our ship
to be completed!

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:46.410
An attack?!

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:49.030
No, that's someone
landing with a Zoom spell!

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:56.290
Aren't you the mage Fobster?!

00:20:56.580 --> 00:21:00.670
I-It's an emergency!
Zababa's been attacked!

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:08.300
A bunch of silver metal beings
attacked the dock!

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:09.600
It's them!

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:11.720
The Hadlar Royal Guard!

00:21:11.890 --> 00:21:13.560
Is everyone all right?!

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:18.270
They're strong! They're incredibly strong!

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.610
<i>There's no way...</i>

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:25.240
<i>I used Zoom to come back and report!</i>

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:26.570
Let's go help them!

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:27.820
Wait!

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:31.200
Zoom can't go anywhere
we've never been before!

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.120
Then we just need to fly north!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:37.790
If Popp and I go on ahead...!

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.880
Don't bother with that.

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:45.380
I'm all the help they need.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:48.970
Who are you?

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:54.060
My name is Nova.

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:57.230
They call me the Hero of the North.

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.320
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.320
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:11.280
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:11.280
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:15.370
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:15.370
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:19.420
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:19.420
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:22.710
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:22.710
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:26.630
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:26.630
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:30.340
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:30.340
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:34.640
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:34.640
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:38.690
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:38.690
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:42.480
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:42.480
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:48.070
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:48.070
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:53.660
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:53.660
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:57.450
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:57.450
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.620 --> 00:22:59.750
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.620 --> 00:22:59.750
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:03.920
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:03.920
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:08.420
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:08.420
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.590 --> 00:23:11.590
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.590 --> 00:23:11.590
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:16.270
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:16.270
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:22.480
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:22.480
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:36.790
<i>The Dark Army attacked
the port town of Zababa.</i>

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:39.160
<i>Nova, the Hero of the North goes to help.</i>

00:23:39.330 --> 00:23:44.290
<i>Waiting for him there are
Hadlar's Orichalcum warriors.</i>

00:23:44.460 --> 00:23:47.590
<i>Nova uses his greatest attack
to fight against Hym.</i>

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:52.970
<i>But no one has yet seen the true terror
of the Hadlar Royal Guard.</i>

00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:55.470
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.640 --> 00:23:57.430
<i>"The Hadlar Royal Guard"</i>

00:23:57.600 --> 00:23:59.600
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
